{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311860","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311860","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1231186001:1":{"text":"아주 적지. 내 옆에 있는 승강기 보여? 예전에는 이 녀석이 멈출 일이 없었어. ","source_cn":"非常少。看见我旁边的升降机了吗？以往它就没停下过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE235AFE101FA88B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1231186002:1":{"text":"하지만 지금은 나처럼 멈춘 지 오래야.","source_cn":"可现在，它和我一起，在码头上发呆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAE2726BEE9EE0DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231186003:1":{"text":"돈을 많이 벌 수 있을 정도로 바빠지면 좋겠어... 계속 이렇게 가다간 술값도 벌지 못할 거야.","source_cn":"真想忙起来多赚些……要再这么下去，我连喝几杯的钱都没有了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x044E5BE3BE263067","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:码头工人托尔提":{"text":"부두 근로자 토르트","source":"码头工人托尔提","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}